                                        <li>In <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/tools/explorer/" target="_blank" class="text-info">Graph API Explorer</a>, request <code>pages_show_list</code> and <code>pages_manage_posts</code>.</li>
                                        <li>Generate a User Token and extend it via <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/accesstoken/" target="_blank" class="text-info">Access Token Debugger</a>.</li>
